      "content": "That's a good start. Can you expand a bit more on that third point regarding the \"cosmopolitan urban centers\"? I'm interested in how the constant movement of traders created specific social or economic structures within those cities. Like, how did the presence of so many different people change the way these markets actually functioned?",
